      <h1>BuildersHaus: The IAM Hub for Every Trade and Service Sector</h1>
      <p class="meta">By Industry Army Marketing · Canonical URL: <a href="https://industryarmymarketing.com/blog/buildershaus-every-trade-one-platform">https://industryarmymarketing.com/blog/buildershaus-every-trade-one-platform</a></p>
      <figure class="hero"><img src="https://industryarmymarketing.com/og-image.jpg" alt="BuildersHaus: The IAM Hub for Every Trade and Service Sector" loading="eager"><figcaption>BuildersHaus: The IAM Hub for Every Trade and Service Sector</figcaption></figure>
      <p class="lede">One infrastructure. One pricing formula. One verification engine. One content system. Deployed across every trade and service sector through BuildersHaus — the IAM hub for construction professionals…</p>
<section id="buildershaus-network-in-canada-the-local-search-problem">
<h2>BuildersHaus Network in Canada: the local search problem</h2>
<p>BuildersHaus is the umbrella hub for every IAM construction domain. Roofers.io, plumbers.ltd, sparkys.tv, hvacr.tv, drywallers.io, painters.tv, framers.io, excavators.tv, rebar.tv, demolition.io, remodelers.io, finishingcarpenters.com and more — every trade plugs into the same backbone.</p>
<p>Most contractors juggle five platforms — a website, a directory listing, a review tool, a lead-gen subscription, and a social scheduler — and none of them talk to each other. BuildersHaus collapses all of it into a single territory-locked listing.</p>

</section>
<section id="how-buildershaus-com-changes-the-equation">
<h2>How buildershaus.com changes the equation</h2>
<p>Pick a trade. Pick a city. The 250 Scale sets the price. EyeSpyR verifies licence, WCB, and insurance. TALC.tv publishes weekly SEO content from one job photo. Leads land in your WhatsApp inside 60 seconds. One operator per trade per metro.</p>

</section>
<section id="the-10-territory-model">
<h2>The $10 territory model</h2>
<p>Industry Army Marketing keeps the offer simple: $10 placements, dofollow pages, direct lead routing, and no inflated retainer layer. The constraint is scarcity — the best city-plus-trade and partner placements are limited by design.</p>

</section>
<section id="faqs"><h2>Frequently asked: BuildersHaus Network in Canada</h2><h3>What does BuildersHaus give me that a website doesn&#39;t?</h3><p>Category domain authority. A standalone .com nobody searches for ranks nowhere. A territory listing on roofers.io or plumbers.ltd inherits 20+ years of topical signal.</p>
<h3>Can I lock more than one trade?</h3><p>Yes — many GCs hold roofing, framing, and remodeling in the same metro. Each trade is its own $10 slot under The 250 Scale.</p>
<h3>Does BuildersHaus replace my Google Business Profile?</h3><p>No, it complements it. Your IAM listing links to and feeds your GBP with TALC.tv posts, photos, and EyeSpyR-verified citations.</p>
<h3>Is there a long-term contract?</h3><p>Never. Month to month. Cancel anytime. The territory unlocks for the next operator the day you cancel.</p>
<h3>What service sectors are covered beyond construction?</h3><p>Moving, landscaping, hardscaping, snow removal, arborists, kitchen cabinets, custom fabrication and growing. The model is sector-agnostic.</p>
<h3>Where is the master pricing?</h3><p>All IAM platform pricing follows The 250 Scale — industryarmymarketing.com/pricing.</p></section>


